{"seq":1,"slug":"arkts-language-fundamentals","title":"ArkTS 语言基础与类型系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/harmonyos-development/arkts-and-arkui/arkts-language-fundamentals","wordCount":1240,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"arkts-语言基础与类型系统\">ArkTS 语言基础与类型系统</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>ArkTS 是 HarmonyOS 应用开发的首选语言，由华为基于 TypeScript 演进而来。它在保留 TypeScript 开发者友好语法的基础上，引入了更严格的静态类型检查和运行时优化策略，使得编译器能够生成更高效的机器码。ArkTS 不是 TypeScript 的超集而是子集加扩展——它限制了 TypeScript 中过于动态的特性（如 <code>any</code> 类型、动态属性访问），同时新增了适配 HarmonyOS 声明式 UI 的装饰器语法。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[TypeScript 完整特性集] --&gt; B[去除动态特性]&#10;    B --&gt; C[ArkTS 静态子集]&#10;    C --&gt; D[新增装饰器扩展]&#10;    D --&gt; E[ArkTS 最终语言规范]&#10;&#10;    B --&gt; F[禁止 any/unknown 滥用]&#10;    B --&gt; G[禁止动态属性访问]&#10;    B --&gt; H[禁止 eval/with]&#10;    D --&gt; I[&quot;@Component 组件装饰器&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; J[&quot;@State 状态装饰器&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; K[&quot;@Entry 入口装饰器&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[TypeScript 完整特性集] --&gt; B[去除动态特性]\n    B --&gt; C[ArkTS 静态子集]\n    C --&gt; D[新增装饰器扩展]\n    D --&gt; E[ArkTS 最终语言规范]\n\n    B --&gt; F[禁止 any/unknown 滥用]\n    B --&gt; G[禁止动态属性访问]\n    B --&gt; H[禁止 eval/with]\n    D --&gt; I[\"@Component 组件装饰器\"]\n    D --&gt; J[\"@State 状态装饰器\"]\n    D --&gt; K[\"@Entry 入口装饰器\"]</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>理解 ArkTS 需要把握几个核心事实：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>子集加扩展</strong>：ArkTS 是 TypeScript 的静态子集，剔除了 <code>any</code>、动态属性访问、<code>eval</code> 等阻碍 AOT 优化的动态特性</li>\n<li><strong>编译期确定一切</strong>：所有类型在编译期完全确定，编译器据此做类型特化、内联展开、逃逸分析和去虚拟化</li>\n<li><strong>装饰器是语言内置</strong>：<code>@Component</code>、<code>@State</code> 等装饰器由编译器直接处理，而非 TypeScript 的实验性特性</li>\n<li><strong>对象字面量必须对应具名类型</strong>：不能使用匿名结构类型，需要显式定义接口或类</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"类型系统与约束规则\">类型系统与约束规则</h2><p>ArkTS 的类型系统在 TypeScript 基础上施加了更严格的约束，核心目标是让所有类型在编译期完全确定，从而支持 AOT（Ahead-of-Time）编译优化。</p>\n<h3 id=\"基本类型约束\">基本类型约束</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型类别</th>\n<th>TypeScript 行为</th>\n<th>ArkTS 约束</th>\n<th>设计原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>any</code></td>\n<td>允许任意使用</td>\n<td>禁止使用</td>\n<td>阻碍 AOT 优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>unknown</code></td>\n<td>允许赋值，需类型守卫使用</td>\n<td>限制使用场景</td>\n<td>鼓励明确类型声明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>联合类型</td>\n<td>无限制</td>\n<td>允许但推荐具名类型</td>\n<td>提高代码可读性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对象字面量</td>\n<td>可任意扩展属性</td>\n<td>必须匹配接口定义</td>\n<td>确保类型安全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>函数重载</td>\n<td>运行时动态分发</td>\n<td>编译期静态解析</td>\n<td>提升运行性能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型断言</td>\n<td><code>as any</code> 等随意使用</td>\n<td>仅允许安全收窄</td>\n<td>防止类型逃逸</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"变量声明规则\">变量声明规则</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// ✅ 推荐：明确类型注解&#10;let userName: string = &#39;张三&#39;;&#10;let userAge: number = 25;&#10;let isActive: boolean = true;&#10;&#10;// ✅ 允许：类型推导（字面量赋值）&#10;let count = 0; // 推导为 number&#10;let items = [&#39;a&#39;, &#39;b&#39;]; // 推导为 string[]&#10;&#10;// ❌ 禁止：无法推导类型&#10;// let data  // 错误：缺少类型注解和初始值&#10;&#10;// ❌ 禁止：any 类型&#10;// let result: any = fetchData()  // 编译错误\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 推荐：明确类型注解</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> userName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '张三'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> userAge</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> isActive</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 允许：类型推导（字面量赋值）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 推导为 number</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> items </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'a'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'b'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 推导为 string[]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ❌ 禁止：无法推导类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// let data  // 错误：缺少类型注解和初始值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ❌ 禁止：any 类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// let result: any = fetchData()  // 编译错误</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"接口与类的类型约束\">接口与类的类型约束</h3><p>ArkTS 强制要求类实现的完整性和接口的精确匹配：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface UserProfile {&#10;  readonly id: string;&#10;  name: string;&#10;  avatar?: string;&#10;  getDisplayName(): string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;class UserProfileImpl implements UserProfile {&#10;  readonly id: string;&#10;  name: string;&#10;  avatar?: string;&#10;&#10;  constructor(id: string, name: string) {&#10;    this.id = id;&#10;    this.name = name;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  getDisplayName(): string {&#10;    return this.avatar ? `${this.name} [有头像]` : this.name;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// ❌ 禁止：动态属性访问&#10;// let key = &#39;name&#39;&#10;// let value = user[key]  // 编译错误：不允许动态索引&#10;&#10;// ✅ 正确：使用明确属性访问&#10;let value = user.name;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UserProfile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  avatar</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  getDisplayName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UserProfileImpl</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> implements</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UserProfile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  avatar</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> name;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  getDisplayName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.avatar </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `${</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} [有头像]`</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.name;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ❌ 禁止：动态属性访问</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// let key = 'name'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// let value = user[key]  // 编译错误：不允许动态索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 正确：使用明确属性访问</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user.name;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"装饰器机制\">装饰器机制</h2><p>装饰器是 ArkTS 中用于声明式 UI 和状态管理的核心语法扩展。与 TypeScript 实验性装饰器不同，ArkTS 装饰器是语言内置特性，由编译器直接处理。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;组件装饰器&quot;&#10;        A[&quot;@Entry&quot;] --&gt; B[页面入口]&#10;        C[&quot;@Component&quot;] --&gt; D[自定义组件]&#10;        E[&quot;@Builder&quot;] --&gt; F[轻量构建函数]&#10;        G[&quot;@BuilderParam&quot;] --&gt; H[构建函数参数]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;状态装饰器&quot;&#10;        I[&quot;@State&quot;] --&gt; J[组件内状态]&#10;        K[&quot;@Prop&quot;] --&gt; L[单向数据流]&#10;        M[&quot;@Link&quot;] --&gt; N[双向数据流]&#10;        O[&quot;@Provide/@Consume&quot;] --&gt; P[跨层级传递]&#10;        Q[&quot;@Observed/@ObjectLink&quot;] --&gt; R[嵌套对象观察]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;其他装饰器&quot;&#10;        S[&quot;@Styles&quot;] --&gt; T[样式复用]&#10;        U[&quot;@Extend&quot;] --&gt; V[组件扩展]&#10;        W[&quot;@Watch&quot;] --&gt; X[状态监听]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph \"组件装饰器\"\n        A[\"@Entry\"] --&gt; B[页面入口]\n        C[\"@Component\"] --&gt; D[自定义组件]\n        E[\"@Builder\"] --&gt; F[轻量构建函数]\n        G[\"@BuilderParam\"] --&gt; H[构建函数参数]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"状态装饰器\"\n        I[\"@State\"] --&gt; J[组件内状态]\n        K[\"@Prop\"] --&gt; L[单向数据流]\n        M[\"@Link\"] --&gt; N[双向数据流]\n        O[\"@Provide/@Consume\"] --&gt; P[跨层级传递]\n        Q[\"@Observed/@ObjectLink\"] --&gt; R[嵌套对象观察]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"其他装饰器\"\n        S[\"@Styles\"] --&gt; T[样式复用]\n        U[\"@Extend\"] --&gt; V[组件扩展]\n        W[\"@Watch\"] --&gt; X[状态监听]\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"组件装饰器详解\">组件装饰器详解</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// @Entry 标记页面入口组件&#10;@Entry&#10;@Component&#10;struct IndexPage {&#10;  @State message: string = &#39;Hello HarmonyOS&#39;&#10;&#10;  build() {&#10;    Column() {&#10;      Text(this.message)&#10;        .fontSize(24)&#10;        .fontWeight(FontWeight.Bold)&#10;&#10;      Button(&#39;点击修改&#39;)&#10;        .onClick(() =&gt; {&#10;          this.message = &#39;你好，鸿蒙！&#39;&#10;        })&#10;    }&#10;    .width(&#39;100%&#39;)&#10;    .height(&#39;100%&#39;)&#10;    .justifyContent(FlexAlign.Center)&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// @Builder 定义可复用的构建函数&#10;@Builder&#10;function CardItem(title: string, content: string) {&#10;  Column() {&#10;    Text(title).fontSize(18).fontWeight(FontWeight.Medium)&#10;    Text(content).fontSize(14).fontColor(&#39;#666666&#39;)&#10;  }&#10;  .padding(16)&#10;  .borderRadius(8)&#10;  .backgroundColor(&#39;#F5F5F5&#39;)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// @Entry 标记页面入口组件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@Entry</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@Component</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">struct IndexPage {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  @State </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">message</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: string </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Hello HarmonyOS'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    Column</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      Text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.message)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fontSize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--